      "name": "@accsci/dsh-auto-retry",
      "title": {
        "en": "Auto retry",
        "zh": "自动重试"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Retry transient provider failures until they succeed, from a GUI switch that never retries quota or credential errors.",
        "zh": "供应商临时故障（超时、断流、限流、5xx）时把模型请求重试到成功；额度、鉴权、请求非法则立即失败。开关在设置与会话头药丸，两处同步。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/accsci-dsh-auto-retry.svg",
